round: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Surge\" title=\"Elemental Surge\">Elemental Surge</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Surge\" title=\"Elemental Surge\">Elemental Surge</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 31<br /><b>Charges: </b>10 (10/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 10 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:10)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+15 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+15 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +103</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +103</a>:</b> Passive: +103 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Wand_of_Blasting.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Wand_of_Blasting.png/420px-Legendary_Wand_of_Blasting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"458\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Wand_of_Blasting.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>Many strange and powerful magical artifacts have been unearthed from the ancient Droaam ruins. This one is a wand that unpredictably casts one of many destructive spells when activated.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">The clicky effect of this wand appears to do about as much damage (10d6 of a random damage type) as the heroic version. Without enhancements to boost wand damage, it is fairly useless.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221511\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2347/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19964/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5490/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.143      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   62.143      1 -total\n 96.11%   59.723      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 54.53%   33.889      5 Template:Popup\n 48.14%   29.918      1 Template:Mat\n 15.64%    9.716     33 Template:IO\n 11.02%    6.849      1 Template:SpellPower\n  9.94%    6.179      1 Template:Bind\n  6.30%    3.915      1 Template:BgColorVar\n  4.93%    3.063      1 Template:Enhancement_bonus\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:101461-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221511 and revision id 633162. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
